---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{% set prefix = "/en" if lang == "en" else "" %}
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <img class="hero-media" src="/images/web/factory-building.jpg" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" eleventy:widths="640,960,1440,1920" sizes="100vw">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="{{ prefix }}/">{% if lang == "en" %}Home{% else %}首页{% endif %}</a><span>/</span><span>{% if lang == "en" %}References{% else %}合作参考{% endif %}</span></nav>
      <span class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER REFERENCES</span>
      <h1>{% if lang == "en" %}Brand and industrial application references{% else %}合作品牌与工业应用参考{% endif %}</h1>
      <p>{% if lang == "en" %}Relevant projects address specific machines and cutting requirements through blade matching, prototype validation and series production.{% else %}相关项目围绕具体设备与切削要求，涵盖刀型匹配、样品验证及批量制造等环节。{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo-wall">
        {% for logo in ["kam", "eastman", "sata", "stanley", "baird-medical", "tti", "jwei", "lectra", "bullmer", "fiskars"] %}
        <div class="logo-item"><img src="/images/logos/{{ logo }}.png" alt="{{ logo }} logo" loading="lazy" eleventy:widths="120,240" sizes="160px"></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="reference-note">{% if lang == "en" %}Trademarks shown belong to their respective owners and are presented only as references to relevant brands or equipment applications.{% else %}所示商标归其权利人所有，仅用于说明相关品牌或设备应用背景。{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT COLLABORATION</span><h2>{% if lang == "en" %}Project review and delivery process{% else %}项目协作流程{% endif %}</h2></div><p>{% if lang == "en" %}The process covers application review, blade and process confirmation, prototype validation and series-production delivery.{% else %}项目流程涵盖应用信息确认、刀具与工艺确认、样品验证及批量交付。{% endif %}</p></div>
      <div class="customer-context">
        <article class="context-item"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Application information{% else %}应用信息确认{% endif %}</strong><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Confirm the industry, machine type, processed material and current operating issue.{% else %}确认所属行业、设备类型、被处理材料及当前使用问题。{% endif %}</p></article>
        <article class="context-item"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Blade and process confirmation{% else %}刀具与工艺确认{% endif %}</strong><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Confirm the blade type, manufacturing process, inspection requirements and delivery scope.{% else %}确认刀具类型、制造工艺、检验要求及交付范围。{% endif %}</p></article>
        <article class="context-item"><strong>{% if lang == "en" %}Prototype and series delivery{% else %}样品验证与批量交付{% endif %}</strong><p>{% if lang == "en" %}Validate the prototype and deliver series production against approved criteria.{% else %}完成样品验证，并依据确认标准实施批量制造与交付。{% endif %}</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% include "partials/rfq-cta.njk" %}
</main>
